OL,3,GNEWSAWhy charities are still clinging
OL,4,Ato a giant cheque
OL,5,
OL,6,FBefore internet banking became the main
OL,7,Fway to pay and send money there was
OL,8,Fanother way to do it ` by writing a
OL,9,Fcheque.
OL,11,FAccording to the Image Clearing System
OL,12,F(ICS), cheque volume has declined 49%
OL,13,Ffrom 2021 to 2025.
OL,15,FPersonally, I only get a cheque as a
OL,16,Fbirthday or Christmas gift from an
OL,17,Felderly relative, but there seems to be
OL,18,Fa group of people who still want to
OL,19,Fcling to using this old-fashioned form
OL,20,Fof banking ` charities who love an
OL,21,Foversized piece of card with big
OL,22,Fnumbers on.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
